WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:12.010
the Giant had many friends.

2
00:00:12.951 --> 00:00:16.294
Everyone liked Jeffrey because he was so kind.

3
00:00:17.635 --> 00:00:21.838
When Peter's ball got stuck in a tree, Jeffrey got it down.

4
00:00:21.858 --> 00:00:25.121
"Thanks, Jeffrey," Peter said.

5
00:00:25.141 --> 00:00:28.444
"Oh, you're welcome, Peter," said Jeffrey.

6
00:00:29.288 --> 00:00:32.690
When Mary hurt herself, Jeffrey carried her home.

7
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.112
"Oh my leg!"

8
00:00:35.552 --> 00:00:36.493
cried Mary.

9
00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:38.174
"Are you okay?

10
00:00:38.854 --> 00:00:40.055
Here, let me help you up.

11
00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:42.957
I'll take you home," said Jeffrey.

12
00:00:42.977 --> 00:00:45.619
"Thanks, Jeffrey," said Mary.

13
00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:48.701
Jeffrey liked to help his friends.

14
00:00:49.981 --> 00:00:52.503
But it was hard for Jeffrey to play with them.

15
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.622
The hiding spots for hide-and-seek were too small.

16
00:01:00.363 --> 00:01:02.144
The jump rope was too short.

17
00:01:05.026 --> 00:01:07.308
The basketball hoop was too low.

18
00:01:08.348 --> 00:01:12.331
The seesaw always went up, but it never came down.

19
00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:18.615
One day Jeffrey left the playground.

20
00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:22.698
He sat down under the biggest tree he could find.

21
00:01:22.718 --> 00:01:26.984
"I am too big to play with my friends," he said to himself.

22
00:01:28.585 --> 00:01:29.765
Jeffrey was sad.

23
00:01:30.665 --> 00:01:32.566
He lowered his head and cried.

24
00:01:32.586 --> 00:01:36.787
"Hi, my name is Eddy.

25
00:01:37.527 --> 00:01:38.207
I'm new here.

26
00:01:38.908 --> 00:01:40.028
Do you want to play with me?"

27
00:01:40.428 --> 00:01:41.188
said a voice.

28
00:01:41.908 --> 00:01:43.349
Jeffrey didn't look up.

29
00:01:44.309 --> 00:01:46.950
"I'm too big to play with anyone," he cried.

30
00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:50.871
"I don't think you're that big," said Eddy.

31
00:01:50.891 --> 00:01:53.531
"Really?" asked Jeffrey.

32
00:01:53.551 --> 00:01:56.769
"Yes, really," said Eddy.

33
00:01:56.789 --> 00:01:58.710
"You're big like me."

34
00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:01.231
Jeffrey looked up hopefully.

35
00:02:02.011 --> 00:02:03.412
Eddy was an elephant!

36
00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:06.554
"Hi," said Jeffrey surprised.

37
00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:08.575
"My name is Jeffrey."

38
00:02:09.836 --> 00:02:10.716
Eddy smiled.

39
00:02:10.736 --> 00:02:12.997
"Why were you crying, Jeffrey?"

40
00:02:13.017 --> 00:02:18.120
"I was crying because I am too big to play with my friends," said Jeffrey.

41
00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:21.702
"You're not too big," said Eddy.

42
00:02:21.722 --> 00:02:25.144
"Let's go to the playground together and I'll show you."

43
00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:31.265
At the playground, Eddy showed Jeffrey new games to play with his friends.

44
00:02:32.186 --> 00:02:35.429
All the children climbed on one side of the seesaw.

45
00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.752
They all climbed on Jeffrey like a mountain.

46
00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:46.239
Jeffrey and Eddy became best friends, and they had fun with the other children.

47
00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.544
But Jeffrey was glad to have such a big friend too.
